/-! # kf-glue, part 2: `ConjIsogMaps`, level 1 — the points bookkeeping (proved)

`ConjIsogMaps` (verbatim above, from scratch/kernel-field) asks for maps `m_σ` on `A_L(ℚ̄)`. We
