`FibreSimple` and `QMModelG3`, and `LinkedTateData` by `LinkedTateCore` (T7 is `t.t7`). -/
theorem afterG7_of_linked (r : HSyn.ResearchLeaves) (t : HSyn.TextbookLeaves)
